{
  "formatVersion": 2,
  "title": "Toggle controls and status feedback",
  "description": "Key 1 and Key 3 toggle L1; Key 2 toggles L1 through L4. Key 1 listens only to 1/1/1, so it can fall out of sync. Key 3 also listens to status feedback on 1/4/1 and stays synchronized. L1 status feedback also turns on L2.",
